  "goodToKnow": "Die Genauigkeit is accuracy or precision: mit höchster Genauigkeit, die Genauigkeit einer Messung. It's seen as a classic German virtue, along with Pünktlichkeit and Ordnung. Genau means exact, and Genau! is one of the most common German responses, meaning exactly or right. Es mit etwas nicht so genau nehmen means to be lax about something. Die Ungenauigkeit is inaccuracy. It has no plural."
